# SC-10: 管理来源
# 流程图: manage-sources.mermaid

flowchart TD
    Start([开始: 用户进入来源页面]) --> EnterRepos[进入来源管理页面<br/>/repositories]
    EnterRepos --> CallAPI[调用 get_repositories API]
    CallAPI --> FetchRepos[获取仓库列表]
    FetchRepos --> RenderList[渲染仓库列表]

    RenderList --> UserAction{用户操作}
    UserAction -->|启用/禁用| ToggleRepo
    UserAction -->|重新扫描| ReScanRepo
    UserAction -->|删除| DeleteRepo

    %% 启用/禁用流程
    ToggleRepo --> ClickToggle[点击启用/禁用按钮]
    ClickToggle --> UpdateEnabled[更新数据库<br/>enabled 字段]
    UpdateEnabled --> RefreshList[刷新列表]
    RefreshList --> UserAction

    %% 重新扫描流程
    ReScanRepo --> ClickReScan[点击重新扫描按钮]
    ClickReScan --> CallScanAPI[调用 scan_repository API]
    CallScanAPI --> ScanFlow[扫描流程<br/>参考 SC-09]
    ScanFlow --> UpdateSkills[更新 Skills]
    UpdateSkills --> UpdateSkillCount[更新 skill_count]
    UpdateSkillCount --> RefreshList
    RefreshList --> UserAction

    %% 删除流程
    DeleteRepo --> ClickDelete[点击删除按钮]
    ClickDelete --> ShowConfirm[显示确认对话框]
    ShowConfirm --> CheckInstalled{检查已安装 Skills}
    CheckInstalled -->|有| ShowWarning[显示警告<br/>未安装的将被移除<br/>已安装的将保留]
    CheckInstalled -->|无| ShowConfirm2[显示确认对话框]
    ShowWarning --> UserConfirm{用户确认?}
    ShowConfirm2 --> UserConfirm

    UserConfirm -->|取消| UserAction
    UserConfirm -->|确认| CheckType{来源类型}
    CheckType -->|Featured| ShowFeaturedError[显示错误<br/>官方精选来源不能删除]
    CheckType -->|User| DeleteRepoDB[删除仓库记录]

    ShowFeaturedError --> UserAction

    DeleteRepoDB --> CascadeDelete[CASCADE 删除关联记录]
    CascadeDelete --> CheckInstalled2{检查已安装 Skills}
    CheckInstalled2 -->|有| UnlinkSkills[解除已安装 Skills 关联]
    CheckInstalled2 -->|无| RefreshList2
    UnlinkSkills --> RefreshList2[刷新列表]
    RefreshList2 --> UserAction

    style Start fill:#e1f5e1
    style ShowFeaturedError fill:#f8d7da
    style ShowWarning fill:#fff3cd
